  "notes": [
    "Spelling-change -AR verb: g→gu before e to preserve the hard /g/ sound",
    "Affects yo pretérito indefinido (*pagué*) and all forms of subjuntivo presente (*pague, pagues, pague, paguemos, paguen*)",
    "Past participle: pagado (regular)",
    "*Pagar en efectivo* = to pay in cash; *pagar con tarjeta* = to pay by card",
    "*Pagar a plazos* = to pay in instalments",
    "*Me las pagarás* = You'll pay for this (idiomatic threat)",
    "Related: el pago (payment), el pagador/a (payer), pagado/a (paid)"
  ],
